## Job
Carry the clerk design to the next sitting, cold. The clerk is the compute on call at the desk. The app is that clerk.
This pack is what was designed, what was learned, what the Director decided, and what is still open. It does not release any work. The open lines below wait for the Director.
If the pack is given to you for review: scores first, opinion second, numbered holes, as AGENTS Colab says. If it is given to you to continue: read the open lines and wait for the Director's reply on each.

## Door
Open this file first. It sits beside the zip and is also the zip's `00.pack.md`.
Then `AGENTS.md` (the seat, version 002), then `AGENTS.003.md` (the draft beside it).
Then `10.workshop/10.10.work/10.10.10.lib/1008.app-plan/04.md`, the overview. It links every part.
Then the four batches `1008.app-plan/05.01.md` to `05.04.md`. Every reply on them is the Director's, transcribed from chat at the Director's request and marked so.
Then the plan parts `plan.1` to `plan.8` as the overview points.
The kernel cards and lib pages in the zip are context. They are copies of 2026-10-17. They are not the seats; the repo holds the seats.

