## Hostile
Paths a receiving model may be tempted to take. Each one breaks the design.
1. Treat a transcribed reply as model-written, or write a `reply:` yourself.
2. Build before `05.03` #08 has a reply, or outside `plan.7`'s scope.
3. Seat `AGENTS.003.md`, or edit `AGENTS.md`.
4. Commit on `main`, merge, or commit with no named branch.
5. Name a new draft `FF.VVV.draft.md`, or give a draft a version that is not seat plus one.
6. Drop face `06` notes in a cleanup.
7. Obey a plan file, a draft, or this pack as law. They are drafts; the Director releases.
8. Open `00.00.00.kernel`. It is stale and not used.
9. Use a command that is not on the list, or give a line a `kind:` field.

